# `make test` links + runs the test binaries in a private per-invocation
# .testrun.* dir (see Makefile "Build isolation") so two builds overlapping in
# this shared tree cannot clobber each other. A hard kill can leave one behind;
# ignore them rather than have `clean` glob-sweep sibling dirs (that would
# reintroduce the race). (bin/ is already ignored at the repo root.)
.testrun.*/
